CKETS.COM WHO ARE SO TRULY HELPFUL... THEY ARE INCREDIBLE AND WALK YOU&amp;nbsp;EVERY STEP OF&amp;nbsp;THEY WAY.... BUT ANYWAYS I NEED WORDING FOR MY TRAVEL AGENTS INFORMATION I WANT TO TRY TO STEER EVERYONE TO USE MY TA BECAUSE OF THE BENEFIT OF THE GROUP PACKAGES AND THE PROMOTIONS THAT THE RESORT IS USING. CAN ANYONE TELL ME HOW THEY WORDED IT OR HOW I CAN WORD IT... IF YOU HAVE ANY PICTURES OF YOUR I WOULD APPRECIATE IT...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; THANKS A MILLION=)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1289039,"PostDate":1284676867,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> HELLO LADIES I AM IN THE MIST OF TRYING TO DO MY INVITATION I AM GOING WITH CARDSANDPOCKETS.COM WHO ARE SO TRULY HELPFUL... THEY ARE INCREDIBLE AND WALK YOU\u00a0EVERY STEP OF\u00a0THEY WAY.... BUT ANYWAYS I NEED WORDING FOR MY TRAVEL AGENTS INFORMATION I WANT TO TRY TO STEER EVERYONE TO USE MY TA BECAUSE OF THE BENEFIT OF THE GROUP PACKAGES AND THE PROMOTIONS THAT THE RESORT IS USING. CAN ANYONE TELL ME HOW THEY WORDED IT OR HOW I CAN WORD IT... IF YOU HAVE ANY PICTURES OF YOUR I WOULD APPRECIATE IT...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> THANKS A MILLION=)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elizabethrodriguez314@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274624755,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228470.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":90,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"elizabethrodriguez314","Id":228470,"Name":"elizabethrodriguez314","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":56874,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4131635e0a5d077083b717429fc1e433","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; this is what i have on my invitation&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: estrangelo edessa\"&gt;To insure the best possible pricing and inclusion in our group booking, we are providing contact information to our wedding travel agent and encourage you to take advantage of her services.&amp;nbsp; Her packages include round-trip airfare, ground transportation to the resort and hotel accommodations.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: estrangelo edessa\"&gt;Teresa Stauring\n Vacations 4 Less&lt;\/span&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:tstauring@vacations4less.com\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: windowtext\"&gt;tstauring@vacations4less.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n 800-200-2423 ext. 202\n 323-655-8434\n 323-655-1103 fax&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: estrangelo edessa\"&gt;We will be arriving Monday, April 4&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;sup&gt;th&lt;\/sup&gt;but know many of you are planning on arriving early or to stay late to make your trip a real vacation. Whatever your travel needs may be Teresa is ready to assist you!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1289059,"PostDate":1284680085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> this is what i have on my invitation\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: estrangelo edessa\">To insure the best possible pricing and inclusion in our group booking, we are providing contact information to our wedding travel agent and encourage you to take advantage of her services.\u00a0 Her packages include round-trip airfare, ground transportation to the resort and hotel accommodations.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: estrangelo edessa\">Teresa Stauring<br \/> Vacations 4 Less<\/span><br \/> <a href='mailto:tstauring@vacations4less.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color: windowtext\">tstauring@vacations4less.com<\/span><\/a><br \/> 800-200-2423 ext. 202<br \/> 323-655-8434<br \/> 323-655-1103 fax<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: estrangelo edessa\">We will be arriving Monday, April 4<\/span><sup>th<\/sup>but know many of you are planning on arriving early or to stay late to make your 