ly: english\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 18pt\"&gt;Travel Information&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: english\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 16pt\"&gt;Our ceremony and reception will be held at the Westin Hotels &amp;amp; Resorts in Aruba. You may go to &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.westinaruba.com\/\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;www.westinaruba.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 20px\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for more information.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: english\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 16pt\"&gt;Our travel agent information is listed below for your convenience.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: english\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 16pt\"&gt;Karen XXXX&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: english\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 16pt\"&gt;Travelplex&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: english\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 16pt\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:Karen@travelplex.com\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;XXXX@travelplex.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: english\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 16pt\"&gt;(800) 737 \u00e2\u20ac\u201c XXX&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: english\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 16pt\"&gt;Ext. XXX&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: english\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 16pt\"&gt;All Arrangements must be finalized by August 31, 2010&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1289191,"PostDate":1284716873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We made a travel information insert for the invitations:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <strong><span  style=\"font-family: english\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-size: 18pt\">Travel Information<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p align=\"center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <span  style=\"font-family: english\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-size: 16pt\">Our ceremony and reception will be held at the Westin Hotels & Resorts in Aruba. You may go to <a href='http:\/\/www.westinaruba.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color: #0000ff\">www.westinaruba.com<\/span><\/a>\u00a0<\/span> <span  style=\"font-size: 20px\"><span><span><span>for more information.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\