{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":175,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1914195,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287077,"Name":"mitzz52","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1465150470,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1914195,"PostDate":1465150470,"PostContent":"Hi all,\u00a0 \u00a0 Better late than never....definitely applicable here! My fiance and I got engaged at t...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mitali.pakvasa@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.251.84.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465149683,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mitzz52","Id":287077,"Name":"mitzz52","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.251.84.10","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b5a3902b68199b7f43cfe8f59cbfd80","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi all,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Better late than never....definitely applicable here! My fiance and I got engaged at the end of November 2015 and are having our big Indian wedding at the Hard Rock Cancun at the end of June 2016. It has certainly been a whirlwind of planning but I wouldn&#039;t do it any other way, we can&#039;t wait to get our married life started! As I&#039;m starting (late I know) to get my welcome bag and welcome letter\/itinerary\/ceremony program\/place cards\/etc together, I&#039;ve definitely been directed to this site and its wonderful resources. I can only hope that I have the time and creative juices to get it done! Here&#039;s to the next few weeks :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was hoping some of you could help me out with a template or two...for maraca tags (I&#039;d seen them on here but can&#039;t remember where!), door tags, labels for survival kits. And of course, anything you all think would be something I need but haven&#039;t thought of!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wish me luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914195,"PostDate":1465150470,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi all,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Better late than never....definitely applicable here! My fiance and I got engaged at the end of November 2015 and are having our big Indian wedding at the Hard Rock Cancun at the end of June 2016. It has certainly been a whirlwind of planning but I wouldn't do it any other way, we can't wait to get our married life started! As I'm starting (late I know) to get my welcome bag and welcome letter\/itinerary\/ceremony program\/place cards\/etc together, I've definitely been directed to this site and its wonderful resources. I can only hope that I have the time and creative juices to get it done! Here's to the next few weeks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was hoping some of you could help me out with a template or two...for maraca tags (I'd seen them on here but can't remember where!), door tags, labels for survival kits. And of course, anything you all think would be something I need but haven't thought of!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wish me luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mitali.pakvasa@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.251.84.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465149683,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mitzz52","Id":287077,"Name":"mitzz52","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.105.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f24d3bea840f58de25804256a8075ec6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the BDW community Mitzz52!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;First off we want to say congratulations on your upcoming wedding. It is just around the corner and you must be already counting down the hours until your big day.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;BDW forums is an amazing resource for brides and you shouldn&#039;t have any trouble getting your questions answered here.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions at all, ask away and feel free to PM us any time&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers! &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914197,"PostDate":1465154427,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the BDW community Mitzz52!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>First off we want to say congratulations on your upcoming wedding. It is just around the corner and you must be already counting down the hours until your big day.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>BDW forums is an amazing resource for brides and you shouldn't have any trouble getting your questions answered here.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you have any questions at all, ask away and feel free to PM us any time<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cheers! <3<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464795939,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.66.4.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80121,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, Yesterday, 08:48 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1465318116,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca0206c6564da02f859d0d815036a5f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow! Congrats on your wedding coming up shortly mitzz52 ~&amp;nbsp; what an exciting time, for sure!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a link to a BDW post from a past bride with her survival kit photos:&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64500-mjkh-wedding-week-survival-bags-are-done-lots-of-pics\/&#039;&gt; Survival Kit&lt;\/a&gt; ...and a sample photo... hope it&#039;s helpful :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592011\/width\/600\/height\/450\" alt=\"450\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....and here&#039;s another link &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72688-my-diy-survival-kit-label-for-oot-bag-with-pics-and-list-of-items-with-price-breakdown\/&#039;&gt;with a list of items this bride used and more photos&lt;\/a&gt; - enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189324\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you best of LUCK with all the last-minute prep and that everything turns out just the way you envision, or Even BETTER!!! cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d798ffb4ab344f1d843692f0c090dc10.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_800,h_533,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d798ffb4ab344f1d843692f0c090dc10.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d798ffb4ab344f1d843692f0c090dc10.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914227,"PostDate":1465316983,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow! Congrats on your wedding coming up shortly mitzz52 ~\u00a0 what an exciting time, for sure!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a link to a BDW post from a past bride with her survival kit photos:<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64500-mjkh-wedding-week-survival-bags-are-done-lots-of-pics\/' class='bbc_url' title=''> Survival Kit<\/a> ...and a sample photo... hope it's helpful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/592011\/width\/600\/height\/450\" alt=\"450\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....and here's another link <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72688-my-diy-survival-kit-label-for-oot-bag-with-pics-and-list-of-items-with-price-breakdown\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>with a list of items this bride used and more photos<\/a> - enjoy!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189324\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you best of LUCK with all the last-minute prep and that everything turns out just the way you envision, or Even BETTER!!! cheers!<\/p>\n<p>Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d798ffb4ab344f1d843692f0c090dc10.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_800,h_533,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d798ffb4ab344f1d843692f0c090dc10.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d798ffb4ab344f1d843692f0c090dc10.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.106.64.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80121,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82affbffa027d0fdd915f6a2da45e792","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"mitzz52\"] &amp;nbsp;Congrats and your upcoming DW! Not long to go!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There are a ton of very recent brides that have posted templates for door hangers, welcome letters, maraca tags, etc. including my thread. Definitely do a search up top. If you want to look under specific brides you can try snswedding2016 or perianjay or deecol, calgarybride2015, tygrlilly, ashhtayy and krystalball. Oh yes and meandhim &amp;nbsp;They all have planning threads and added their templates to their threads and have all been married within the last year and a half. I also have templates at home that I could add in if you get really stuck.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914234,"PostDate":1465320531,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287077\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287077-mitzz52\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mitzz52<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Congrats and your upcoming DW! Not long to go!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There are a ton of very recent brides that have posted templates for door hangers, welcome letters, maraca tags, etc. including my thread. Definitely do a search up top. If you want to look under specific brides you can try snswedding2016 or perianjay or deecol, calgarybride2015, tygrlilly, ashhtayy and krystalball. Oh yes and meandhim \u00a0They all have planning threads and added their templates to their threads and have all been married within the last year and a half. I also have templates at home that I could add in if you get really stuck.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80121","Title":"Hard Rock Cancun...3 Weeks!","LastPostDate":1465320531},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
