> User brittkay (287100)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1777,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1840470,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":276380,"Name":"Hanna14","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1395781552,"LastPoster":{"Id":262321,"Name":"andiegarcia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262321.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":118,"Preview":{"Id":1840470,"PostDate":1395781552,"PostContent":"Hi girls!! \u00a0 I was wondering if anyone has any advice for me.... \u00a0We have the Ultimate Wedding Pa...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hanna.pool@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.62.66.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390949726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hanna14","Id":276380,"Name":"Hanna14","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.62.66.215","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76679,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c47761619288e330c4be7e12a356c7e4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi girls!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was wondering if anyone has any advice for me.... &amp;nbsp;We have the Ultimate Wedding Package and are planning on using the photographer included in the package, can any tell me what this includes besides 50 photos, are they there the whole time, ceremony and reception? &amp;nbsp;Same with videographer?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone recommend an awesome DJ for us??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone recommend an awesome minister for our symbolic ceremony?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We want a light hearted ceremony as well as a DJ with a fun sense of humor. &amp;nbsp;Please let me know if y&#039;all have any ideas. And if you have any other advice for Dreams Los Cabos Weddings in general, food, decoration, etc...anything.. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What about a Bonfire Party? &amp;nbsp;Has anyone ever done this before, we are thinking for our rehearsal after dinner party but don&#039;t know if it is worth the price. &amp;nbsp;:)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks guys!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hanna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840470,"PostDate":1395781552,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi girls!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was wondering if anyone has any advice for me.... \u00a0We have the Ultimate Wedding Package and are planning on using the photographer included in the package, can any tell me what this includes besides 50 photos, are they there the whole time, ceremony and reception? \u00a0Same with videographer?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone recommend an awesome DJ for us??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone recommend an awesome minister for our symbolic ceremony?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We want a light hearted ceremony as well as a DJ with a fun sense of humor. \u00a0Please let me know if y'all have any ideas. And if you have any other advice for Dreams Los Cabos Weddings in general, food, decoration, etc...anything.. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What about a Bonfire Party? \u00a0Has anyone ever done this before, we are thinking for our rehearsal after dinner party but don't know if it is worth the price. \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks guys!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hanna<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hanna.pool@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.62.66.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390949726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hanna14","Id":276380,"Name":"Hanna14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76679,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8260c5e89a415ca94ffd1fbb110b0bae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to BDW! I would highly recommend checking out the other forums for Dreams. This site is full of information that should help you out!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840479,"PostDate":1395783772,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to BDW! I would highly recommend checking out the other forums for Dreams. This site is full of information that should help you out!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.149.102.163","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76679,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a972941c084890c837f6be39274b2e5a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi, I&#039;m getting married on 5\/31\/14 at Dreams. I also have the Ultimate Dreams package but am not using the photographer. I am using Alec &amp;amp; T, they&#039;re pricey but pics are important to us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For our ceremony we are using Marco Arechiga (sp?), we&#039;ve heard nothing but great things and so far communication has been great.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck planning, it goes by FAST!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840704,"PostDate":1395866685,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi, I'm getting married on 5\/31\/14 at Dreams. I also have the Ultimate Dreams package but am not using the photographer. I am using Alec & T, they're pricey but pics are important to us.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For our ceremony we are using Marco Arechiga (sp?), we've heard nothing but great things and so far communication has been great.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck planning, it goes by FAST!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marisol.salguero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"161.149.63.168","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362945137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267159.jpg?_r=1404881843","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SCchickie","Id":267159,"Name":"SCchickie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.62.66.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76679,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c18275b42d85171882ec749e4f99496","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks girls. &amp;nbsp;Yeah that is the second time I heard of Marco for the ceremony. &amp;nbsp;We will definitely try to get him, especially if he has been communicating well with you in advance. &amp;nbsp;:) &amp;nbsp;Photos are important to us as well and we still don&#039;t know. &amp;nbsp;I wonder if we get a better package with Dreams thru the resort if they will be good and worth it? &amp;nbsp;Or is it worth going outside the hotel to find someone. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wow, May is so soon, and you&#039;re right it goes by super fast as it has already. &amp;nbsp;Good luck and let us know how wonderful your wedding is. &amp;nbsp;:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1840771,"PostDate":1395890509,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks girls. \u00a0Yeah that is the second time I heard of Marco for the ceremony. \u00a0We will definitely try to get him, especially if he has been communicating well with you in advance. \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0Photos are important to us as well and we still don't know. \u00a0I wonder if we get a better package with Dreams thru the resort if they will be good and worth it? \u00a0Or is it worth going outside the hotel to find someone. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wow, May is so soon, and you're right it goes by super fast as it has already. \u00a0Good luck and let us know how wonderful your wedding is. \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hanna.pool@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.62.66.215","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390949726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hanna14","Id":276380,"Name":"Hanna14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.60.68.42","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76679,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e436b4db9a180aeffd7450041e1e5420","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We booked Dennis Berti for our photographer for our 6\/14\/14 wedding.&amp;nbsp; A lot less than Alec &amp;amp; T with similar quality.&amp;nbsp; Check out his website.. DennisBerti.com!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ll share his work as soon as we have pics available!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852813,"PostDate":1401472302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We booked Dennis Berti for our photographer for our 6\/14\/14 wedding.\u00a0 A lot less than Alec & T with similar quality.\u00a0 Check out his website.. DennisBerti.com!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We'll share his work as soon as we have pics available!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andiengarcia@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.140.67.22","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352780411,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262321.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"andiegarcia","Id":262321,"Name":"andiegarcia","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"76679","Title":"Dj, Minister, & Photographer Recommendations Please!","LastPostDate":1401472302},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
